# super-review workbench

- Canonical skill source is `src/super-review/` only. Never edit `dist/` or `docs/ORIGINAL_REVIEW_PROMPT.md`.
- Read `AGENTS.md` (14 invariants) and `docs/AGENT_OPERATIONS.md` (change discipline, coupling, validation, versioning) before substantive edits.
- Shipped helpers under `src/super-review/scripts/` are stdlib-only and resolve from the skill root, never the target CWD.
- Before completion: `python3 scripts/check.py` and `make lint`. Do not commit, push, publish, or deploy from tooling.
- Dev pins must match in `pyproject.toml` `[dependency-groups].dev` and `requirements-dev.txt`.
